{"id":543,"title":{"romaji":"D.Gray-man Hallow","english":"D.Gray-man HALLOW","native":"ディー・グレイマン ハロー"},"slug":"dgray_man_hallow","synopsis":"Despite the recent Akuma attack, the members of the Black Order are in high spirits as they set about moving to a new base. Immediately upon his arrival, however, Allen Walker is suddenly called by the Central Agency and has his arm forcefully sealed by the Order. He is then led to a surprising meeting with his master, General Cross Marian, who reveals staggering secrets surrounding the enigmatic 14th Noah.\n\nA phantom thief incident, the arrival of a mysterious group of Exorcists, the death of an important comrade, and an all-out battle against the Noah Family—just what does this mean for Allen, Yuu Kanda, and the rest of the Order? This is but the beginning of a series of strange, seemingly unconnected events that lead to something far greater.\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)","format":"TV","season":"SUMMER","year":2016,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:43:39","updatedAt":"2025-05-23 11:23:25","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":32370},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":21558},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":11654},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":11848},{"site":"ANN","externalId":18193},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":7656},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"HULU","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":1081,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/PQXezw9RG36CiEEUwpivEKeQoCScUMtywLFMMR35.png"},{"id":1082,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/ErRQzVaalEbjn2i5EErofalGsbSnX7ypKylFZIVU.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":40,"name":"TMS Entertainment","slug":"tms_entertainment"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":30,"name":"D.Gray-man","slug":"dgm"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":6797,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":6797,"title":{"romaji":"Key -bring it on, my Destiny-","native":null}},"animethemeentries":[{"id":7898,"v